{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>And they made</b> — <b>the king of Assyria</b>: This is Artaxerxes. He mentioned Assyria and not Persia, because the kings of Assyria destroyed the land of Israel, and now He turned his heart from his evil design to good, and this is the meaning of \"to strengthen their hands.\""], :book :ezra, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Ezra -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:42:04.861490091Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}